OL,3,GNEWSANHS dental services to return to
OL,4,ARamsey
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS dental services will return to
OL,7,FRamsey next month, with patients on
OL,8,Fwaiting lists among the first to be
OL,9,Foffered appointments.
OL,11,FManx Care said a dentist would begin
OL,12,Fseeing patients at Ramsey and District
OL,13,FCottage Hospital from the week
OL,14,Fbeginning 2 November.
OL,16,FThe service will initially be available
OL,17,Fto people in the north of the island
OL,18,Fwho are on the NHS dental waiting list,
OL,19,Fas well as unregistered patients
OL,20,Frequiring emergency treatment.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
